    "steam_appid": 2606610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606610/extras/c4dae4a0a7cb4b4adc694b237441e639.avif?t=1696842032\" width=600 height=192 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Supply energy to many spaceships in this small, chill resource and time management game.<br><br>A Cooked-Like, if you will!&quot;</h2><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606610/extras/cc62d7c92504618fe6fb75506b5fe5d4.avif?t=1696842032\" width=538 height=302 /></span><br><br>Handle machinery and energizing items as <strong>Bobby</strong>, a spaceship engineer, in this short game, inspired by Overcooked!<br>After a long development time, this game proudly sports polished <i>pixel animations</i> and <i>orchestra-chiptune hybrids</i>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Controls (Keyboard/gamepad)</u>:</h2>WASD/Arrows/Stick/D-pad to move.<br>Space/Enter/E/Action Buttons to interact with objects.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Credits:</u></h2>Art: Blawnode, KingKelpo.<br><br>Code: redsti, Blawnode, Nazsgull (Prototyping).<br>Music: NoStereo.<br>SFX: sound_digitator.<br><br>Made with Unity 2020.3.17f1 and FMod 2.01.11.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Links and socials (also seen in-game, in the main menu's credits!)</u></h2><br>Blawnode<br>    Twitter: @blawnode <br><br>Ajoeb &quot;KingKelpo&quot; Gaasim<br>    Twitter: @kelpoking<br><br>Nazsgull<br>    Twitter: @pabloarev<br><br>redsti<br>    Twitter: @redsti<br><br>NoStereo<br>    Twitter: @NoStereoMusic<br><br>Gene &quot;sound_digitator&quot; Chaban<br>    Twitter: @genechab_audio",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606610/extras/c4dae4a0a7cb4b4adc694b237441e639.avif?t=1696842032\" width=600 height=192 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Supply energy to many spaceships in this small, chill resource and time management game.<br><br>A Cooked-Like, if you will!&quot;</h2><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606610/extras/cc62d7c92504618fe6fb75506b5fe5d4.avif?t=1696842032\" width=538 height=302 /></span><br><br>Handle machinery and energizing items as <strong>Bobby</strong>, a spaceship engineer, in this short game, inspired by Overcooked!<br>After a long development time, this game proudly sports polished <i>pixel animations</i> and <i>orchestra-chiptune hybrids</i>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Controls (Keyboard/gamepad)</u>:</h2>WASD/Arrows/Stick/D-pad to move.<br>Space/Enter/E/Action Buttons to interact with objects.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Credits:</u></h2>Art: Blawnode, KingKelpo.<br><br>Code: redsti, Blawnode, Nazsgull (Prototyping).<br>Music: NoStereo.<br>SFX: sound_digitator.<br><br>Made with Unity 2020.3.17f1 and FMod 2.01.11.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Links and socials (also seen in-game, in the main menu's credits!)</u></h2><br>Blawnode<br>    Twitter: @blawnode <br><br>Ajoeb &quot;KingKelpo&quot; Gaasim<br>    Twitter: @kelpoking<br><br>Nazsgull<br>    Twitter: @pabloarev<br><br>redsti<br>    Twitter: @redsti<br><br>NoStereo<br>    Twitter: @NoStereoMusic<br><br>Gene &quot;sound_digitator&quot; Chaban<br>    Twitter: @genechab_audio",
